{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8001_p", "source_sha256": "01cf02567d3a71a50720f1d9aa413faab0e9301a30879b71d06da1aa0580f580", "ja": "（アイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』のグラビア企画。\n桃子のテーマは『令和ギャルの日常』だ）", "zh": "（偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真特辑。\n桃子的主题是“令和辣妹的日常”）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8002_049mom", "source_sha256": "b38386692aef00797e19ff6aadb5f6a1ed6c86d842a6de8028edf8136b982f6f", "ja": "放課後の学校で撮る、ショート動画……。\nうーん……どうしようかな……。", "zh": "在放学后的学校里拍短视频……。\n嗯……该怎么办呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8003_p", "source_sha256": "8df0e39b585411329ba36279996ff8700a462b80b9749595581bcab79212a2d8", "ja": "桃子、お疲れさま。\nずいぶん悩んでいるみたいだけど……。", "zh": "桃子，辛苦了。\n你似乎烦恼了很久……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8004_049mom", "source_sha256": "1de33a8719f3f5621a379967159830c15a8d3c098c0ca4a3d46cbbbed1278ccc", "ja": "あ、お兄ちゃん。……今日の撮影、\n動画を撮ってる様子を撮るでしょ？", "zh": "啊，哥哥。……今天的拍摄，是要拍下录制视频的样子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8005_049mom", "source_sha256": "60cd2ff59a5a996b61293f2893680c42ddcb7f67bc31d94078fba6ff4cf02cf6", "ja": "やってみたい動画があったら教えてほしいって、\nさっきスタッフさんに言われたの。", "zh": "工作人员刚刚跟我说，\n要是有什么想拍的视频，就告诉他们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8006_049mom", "source_sha256": "37bafa429588ce9cb5d89a95ad394c1fc85c2f87253a8a1e0dbbf6d75b526d26", "ja": "でも、ショート動画にもいろんなジャンルがあるし、\nどういうのにしようか迷ってて……。", "zh": "不过，短视频也有各种各样的类型，我还在犹豫要拍哪一种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8007", "source_sha256": "943b49d9bf76f745dfc83f2b4713b3662618067f26689aef51eaf1d274dc9c68", "ja": "紹介動画", "zh": "介绍视频", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_049mom_8000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_049mom_8008", "source_sha256": "38658a64729ced372c4a2b5f2a09ae19062f7c6be20070d3482c69bbca4ef3bd", "ja": "ダンス動画", "zh": "舞蹈视频", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
